=== J. FINRA 2261: most recent balance sheet available to inspection by any bona fide regular customer upon request ===
2261(a): A member shall make available to inspection by any bona fide regular customer, upon request,
  the information relative to such member's financial condition as disclosed in its most recent
  balance sheet prepared either in accordance with such member's usual practice or as required by
  any state or federal securities laws, or any rule or regulation thereunder
