=== N. FINRA 4340: callable securities fair-and-impartial allocation and customer notice ===
4340(a): Each member that has in its possession or under its control any security which, by
  its terms, may be called or redeemed prior to maturity, shall:
  (1) establish and make available on the member's website procedures by which it will
  allocate among its customers, on a fair and impartial basis, the securities to be redeemed
  or selected as called in the event of a partial redemption or call; and
  (2) provide written notice (which may be electronic) to new customers at the opening of an
  account, and all customers at least once every calendar year, of the manner in which they
  may access the allocation procedures on the member's website and that, upon a customer's
  request, the member will provide hard copies of the allocation procedures to the customer
